{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17381","headline":"奉和史馆张阁老以许陈二阁长爱弟俱爲尚书郎伯仲同时列在南北省会於左掖因而有咏 · 权德舆","name":"奉和史馆张阁老以许陈二阁长爱弟俱爲尚书郎伯仲同时列在南北省会於左掖因而有咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伯仲尽时贤，平舆与颍川。\n桂枝尝徧折，棣萼更相鲜。\n丹地晨趋并，黄扉夕拜联。\n岂如分侍从，来就凤池边。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17381.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17381","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}